==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*20 [[Croco]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Fast cooldown tanks are useful as they can deal with the Rain D. and can protect the base if zombies don't get interrupted. LD units are also useful as the peons can get in the way and Rain D. having a high knockback count for area control and can keep zombies on the front line.

